<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cont de plată Nr. {{nrmanual}}</title>
<style>
  /* RO: varianta HTML a contului — dupa modelul aprobat
     «Primaria_Japca_Cont_de_plata.html» (stil site / una.md). */
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;
         color: #222; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 20px; }
  .invoice { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff;
             border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 24px 28px;
             box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
  .header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a5fb4;
            padding-bottom: 14px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .header-left { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .header-right { flex: 0 0 auto; margin-left: auto; text-align: right;
                  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; }
  .logo-img { max-width: 240px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; }
  .bold-label { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; }
  .party-title { font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #333; }
  .party-info { line-height: 1.45; color: #444; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .invoice-meta { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 13px; text-align: right; }
  .invoice-meta strong { font-size: 24px; color: #1a5fb4; display: block;
                         margin-bottom: 2px; font-weight: bold; }
  .invoice-meta .invoice-nr { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-size: 16px; }
  .invoice-meta .invoice-date { font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; display: block;
                                margin-top: 2px; }
  table { table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
  th { background: #1a5fb4; color: #fff; padding: 4px 3px; text-align: center;
       font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid #0d4a8f; }
  td { padding: 2px 3px; border: 1px solid #ccc; vertical-align: middle; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f8fafc; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: #eef4fb; }
  .col-nr { width: 4%; text-align: center; }
  .col-cod { width: 12%; text-align: center; }
  .col-den { width: 47%; text-align: left; }
  .col-cant { width: 7%; text-align: center; }
  .col-um { width: 7%; text-align: center; }
  .col-pret { width: 10%; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap;
              padding: 2px 4px !important; }
  .col-suma { width: 13%; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;
              padding: 2px 4px !important; }
  .totals { margin-top: 10px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .totals-box { width: 300px; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px 14px;
                background: #f8fafc; }
  .totals-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 4px 0;
                border-bottom: 1px dotted #ddd; }
  .totals-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;
                           color: #1a5fb4; margin-top: 4px; padding-top: 6px; }
  .amount-words { margin-top: 14px; padding: 10px 12px; background: #eef4fb;
                  border-left: 4px solid #1a5fb4; font-size: 13px; }
  .signatures { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 36px;
                padding-top: 12px; }
  .sig-block { width: 42%; text-align: center; }
  .sig-label { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .sig-line { border-top: 1px solid #333; padding-top: 4px; font-size: 11px;
              color: #555; }
  .validity-note { margin: 8px 0 4px; text-align: right; font-size: 12px;
                   color: #333; line-height: 1.5; }
  .validity-note strong { color: #1a5fb4; }
  @media print { body { background: #fff; padding: 0; }
                 .invoice { box-shadow: none; border: none; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="invoice">
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-left">
      <div class="party-title"><span class="bold-label">Furnizor:</span> {{firm.name}}</div>
      <div class="party-info">
        <span class="bold-label">Adresa:</span> {{firm.address}}{{#if firm.phone}}, {{firm.phone}}{{/if}}<br>
        <span class="bold-label">Cont de decontare nr.: {{firm.iban}}</span><br>
        {{firm.bank}}{{#if firm.branch}} &nbsp;|&nbsp; BIC: {{firm.branch}}{{/if}}<br>
        <span class="bold-label">Cod fiscal: {{firm.fiscal_code}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="party-title"><span class="bold-label">Plătitor:</span></div>
      <div class="party-info" style="margin-bottom:0;">
        <span class="bold-label">{{client.name}}{{#if client.address}}, {{client.address}}{{/if}}{{#if client.phone}}, Tel: {{client.phone}}{{/if}}</span><br>
        {{#if client.iban}}<span class="bold-label">Cont de decontare nr.: {{client.iban}}</span><br>{{/if}}
        {{#if client.bank}}{{client.bank}}{{#if client.bic}}, BIC: {{client.bic}}{{/if}}<br>{{/if}}
        {{#if client.fiscal_code}}<span class="bold-label">Cod fiscal: {{client.fiscal_code}}</span>{{/if}}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
      {{#if logo}}<img src="{{logo}}" alt="OfficePlus" class="logo-img">{{/if}}
      <div class="invoice-meta">
        <strong>CONT DE PLATĂ</strong>
        <span class="invoice-nr">Nr. {{nrmanual}}</span>
        <span class="invoice-date">din {{date_ro}}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="validity-note">
    Contul e valabil timp de <strong>TREI</strong> zile.<br>
    Vă mulțumim pentru achitarea la timp.
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th class="col-nr">№</th>
        <th class="col-cod">Cod<br>Articol</th>
        <th class="col-den">Denumirea<br>Produsului</th>
        <th class="col-cant">Cant.</th>
        <th class="col-um">Un. de<br>măs.</th>
        <th class="col-pret">Prețul</th>
        <th class="col-suma">Sumă</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {{#each items}}
      <tr>
        <td class="col-nr">{{inc @index}}</td>
        <td class="col-cod">{{cod}}</td>
        <td class="col-den">{{name}}</td>
        <td class="col-cant">{{qty}}</td>
        <td class="col-um">{{um}}</td>
        <td class="col-pret">{{fmt price}}</td>
        <td class="col-suma">{{fmt sum}}</td>
      </tr>
      {{/each}}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="totals">
    <div class="totals-box">
      <div class="totals-row"><span>TOTAL:</span><span>{{fmt total}}</span></div>
      <div class="totals-row"><span>{{tva_label}}</span><span>{{tva_text}}</span></div>
      <div class="totals-row"><span>Total spre plată:</span><span>{{fmt total}}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="amount-words">
    <strong>Total de plată:</strong> {{amount_words}}
  </div>

  <div class="signatures">
    <div class="sig-block">
      <div class="sig-label">Conducătorul</div>
      <div class="sig-line">Director{{#if firm.director}}: {{firm.director}}{{/if}}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sig-block">
      <div class="sig-label">Contabil Șef</div>
      <div class="sig-line">Contabil șef</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
